# Next.js API Route Optimization

## Overview
Optimizing API routes in Next.js for better performance by parallelizing async operations and reducing unnecessary calls.

## Key Patterns

### 1. Parallel API Calls with Promise.all
When you have multiple independent API calls, run them in parallel:

```typescript
// BAD - Sequential (slow)
