In Next.js App Router, Server Components can fetch data in parallel:

```typescript
export default async function Page() {
  // Parallel fetching in server components
  const [user, products] = await Promise.all([
    fetchUser(),
    fetchProducts(),
  ]);

  return <Component user={user} products={products} />;
}
```

## Best Practices
- Use `Promise.all()` for independent async operations
- Don't await logging/analytics calls unless necessary
- Consider using `Promise.allSettled()` if some calls can fail independently
